// (q: the place less the stream's rate times the clock, so the cells ride with the water), wide metres across,
// taken at STREAK.TAPS places along the mirrored ray's own lie on the sheet (rh) over len metres and meaned: a
// field drawn out along the ray and one ripple wide across it. It goes into its mean where a cell is finer than
