      // near) is handed keepClear besides: the flown route's own points of that stretch and the least distance the
      // kit is to keep its birds from them. (THIS TREE'S KIT, the older engine, READS NO keepClear: here it is
      // handed to nothing and these flocks fly their loops as the others do; the owner's engine reads it, by the
