      scene, path, duration: flight.duration, pace: flight.pace,
      camera: { fov: 40, near: 0.3, far: 7000, lookAhead: 20, sway: 0.6, bank: 0.1 },
      pois: flight.looks,
      // revealDistance, its rule (R7, the owner's ruling B of 01:38 UTC on 11 Oct 2026: the one field, set to a named
      // place of the walk): the way still to go from THE GAP'S EAST DIPPING BASIN (the part's DOOR_SEEN_J; the flight's
      // mark doorSeen, where the lens comes abreast of that basin's feeder). By the engine's own law the opening
